@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### All known devices (last seen)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/devices

### Latest value of every sensor
GET {{host}}/api/v1/readings/latest

### Latest values for one device
GET {{host}}/api/v1/readings/latest?deviceId=coldroom-01

### Last hour of readings (default range), one device and sensor
GET {{host}}/api/v1/readings?deviceId=coldroom-01&sensor=temperature&limit=20

### Readings in a time range
GET {{host}}/api/v1/readings?deviceId=coldroom-01&sensor=temperature&from=2026-11-16T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-16T23:59:59Z&limit=500

### All events (last hour)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/events

### Critical events only
GET {{host}}/api/v1/events?severity=critical

### Events for one device and type
GET {{host}}/api/v1/events?deviceId=coldroom-01&type=DoorOpen&limit=50

### Posting the reading
POST {{host}}/api/v1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

[{"deviceId":"coldroom-99","sensor":"temperature","value":3.8,"unit":"C"}]